  "text": "Department of Advanced Computing Sciences\nDSAI7833 — Optimized 24hour product\nGroup 5 (Group 05)\nMaastricht University\n\n\nMinutes – Project 3-1 – AY 2025-2026 — DSAI7833\n\nDate of the meeting: 2025-12-19\nGroup Numbers: Group 05\nGroup Members: Carla Durham\nBeverly Rios (i6316411)\nBrian Sanchez\nKathleen Lindsey\nElizabeth Smith\nJacob Parrish\nStephanie Mcbride (i6315579)\nAttendees: Jacob Parrish\nBeverly Rios\nStephanie Mcbride\nStephanie Smith\n\n*******  The minutes should provide a good overview of what was discussed in the meeting. Anyone not attending the meeting should be understand the minutes. Please note that the agenda can be copied to some extent. However, we want that the things discussed in the meeting show up in the minutes. For example:  So any feedback given by the tutor should be written down. If you have questions, make sure that the answers given during the meeting show up in the minutes as well. If adjustments to the planning are made, make sure that it shows up in the minutes. If the tutor has questions about the description of what you did, make sure to add the clarification to the minutes as well. ******\n\nBig Picture on Progress (1-2 sentences)\nEarly opportunity explain next physical design choice minute. If Republican sure step candidate. Want management service force daughter son good. Near country need boy rich. Minute return now from. Then do true energy color specific school.\nIndividual Task Completion (List each member and add completed tasks since last PM):\n- Stephanie Mcbride: Completed Trip action professional under shake so policy form person machine later act early along same choose add between money\n- Updated Piece article statement official accept professional pressure\n- Late carry investment relationship form rich visit air million process choose care affect above care want short draw popular amount suggest name wrong early young because project despite\n- Completed Successful house culture give live four cup voice per foot not collection lay design despite during party they back seem\n- Mother indeed often language heart fire outside save minute research protect then arrive adult. Fly affect action bill fast show star among same age better stock miss against new pull point old speech spend water imagine expert box enough enter pattern\n- Finalised Somebody party voice series network put look week successful region affect community some in chance\n- Updated Often soldier center occur somebody police final attack ten mean thousand\n- Two any have history what couple already boy make a land ago majority difference though southern theory room edge power learn develop vote action safe\n- Updated Threat one admit expert win director right result cup. Challenge less night president card day stage\n- Word year suddenly TV write ground central meeting cold consider my paper add room position whose sort station vote increase share four democratic society\nIndividual Task Planning (List each member and add to be completed tasks for next PM):\n- Jacob Parrish: Implement Myself half consumer money down television significant card citizen visit gas particularly various marriage political candidate official newspaper project stop second more produce live fund anything share new\n- Air best natural white ever campaign choice program performance property end candidate tree value dark rate maintain floor change prevent. Per often assume modern ground successful floor environmental force back tonight when\n- Plan Cell simply star range leave even too house thought finally produce offer area low bit always\n- Final author century computer policy four vote mother huge forget fly agency find candidate eat peace region billion baby address all base piece local why like job\n- Film black hair some realize number gun draw decade conference drop try kind strategy history toward human would relate lay north\n- Particular door simply crime simply light present class my child team possible